  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "The Adani One ICICI Platinum Credit Card is the entry-level offering from the co-branded partnership between Adani One and ICICI Bank. It offers benefits around card activation, renewal, airport-linked services, lounge access, reward earnings, and redemption. Cardholders can earn accelerated (3%) Adani reward points on spends within the Adani ecosystem and redeem them for travel services and bookings via the Adani One portal. Besides this, the card also offers 1.5% value back on international spends , 1% on other spends, and 0.5% on utility and insurance spends. For frequent travellers, the card offers basic domestic lounge access benefits along with premium airport-linked services like lounge upgrades, premium car parking, porter services , and more.",
